{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31095","headline":"寄唐州杨郎中 · 薛能","name":"寄唐州杨郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"关雎憔悴一儒生，忽把鱼须事圣明。\n贫得俸钱还乍喜，晚登朝序却无荣。\n前年坐蜀同樽俎，此日边淮独斾旌。\n班列道孤君不见，曲江春暖共僧行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31095.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31095","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}